# F1i. #308 claude F-VM-08 and F-VM-16: the GENERIC_X64 emulator configs the
#      image installs carried other devices' hardware. (Cemu, RPCS3, xemu,
#      Dolphin and Supermodel, the rest the seats named, are not in the
#      GENERIC_X64 SYSTEM at 7911c53bb4.)
F1I="${F1}/i"; mkdir -p "${F1I}"; F1EMU=projects/ROCKNIX/packages/emulators/standalone
# mupen64plus: [Input-SDL-Control1] named SM8250's pad. Under mode = 2
