# cloud_oauth, graded in-process and as processes, inside a bwrap sandbox with
# its own pid and network namespaces (so the /proc walks, the port binds and
# the kills reach nothing outside it). No uinput, no sysfs, no sway: those are
# patched per test.
#
#   cloud_oauth_test.py run <cloud_oauth> <workdir>     every test, P/F lines, END
#   cloud_oauth_test.py drive <cloud_oauth> <workdir> <command...>
#                                                       cloud_oauth's main() with
#                                                       the sandbox patches
