# count), the layout key is one of them, the rows it builds fit OSK_COLS,
# osk_press toggles the layout on that key's label, and osk_relabel draws
# OSK_SYMBOLS when it is on. Static reads of the source -- the frames at
# 640x480 are still the proof the keyboard draws it.
